# Next.js 15 App Router + shadcn/ui + Tailwind v4

- App Router under `apps/web/app`. Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only where you need state/effects/the STDB live connection.
- Routes: `/` marketing, `/dashboard` (Clerk-protected organizer), `/e/[slug]` attendee app, `/e/[slug]/join`, `/e/[slug]/screen` (public spectator/projector).
- The SpacetimeDB provider + all `useTable`/`useReducer` usage are in client components only.
- Tailwind v4: CSS-first config via `@import "tailwindcss"` in `globals.css` + `@tailwindcss/postcss` in `postcss.config.mjs`. No `tailwind.config.js` unless a feature needs it.
- shadcn/ui: add components with the CLI into `apps/web/components/ui`. Keep them composable; theme via CSS variables. Prefer accessible primitives (Radix under the hood).
- Charts: lightweight-charts for live market price history; recharts for organizer analytics.
- Accessibility: semantic roles, labels, keyboard nav, sufficient contrast (projector view especially).
